# Drawer Field Labels

Individual field labels inside Denison Tennis OS slide-over drawers use regular or medium weight. They must never use semibold or bold typography. Section headings, record titles, and actions are exempt.

## Rules

- Prefer `DrawerField` from `@/components/workspace-drawer`, or `typeRole.drawerFieldLabel` / `typeRole.drawerFieldLabelMuted`.
- Use body/UI font at `font-medium` (or regular). Never `font-semibold` or `font-bold` on individual field labels.
- Do not use heavy all-caps for individual field labels. Clarity comes from size, spacing, and color.
- Applies to create/edit/detail drawers on desktop and mobile.
- Section headings (e.g. CONTACT, OFFICIATING, NOTES), record titles, and action buttons may keep stronger treatment.
- Do not change drawer geometry, spacing, input styling, or layout when applying this rule — weight only for labels.
